{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"bc60a5f5-8479-42a6-b00b-736df0b42d18","update":{"_meta":{"claudeCode":{"toolName":"Write"}},"toolCallId":"call_304ca2a5432d4c038125c7b9","sessionUpdate":"tool_call_update","rawInput":{"file_path":"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-fixtures/eighth-20261023/worktree/src/normalize_text.py","content":"\"\"\"换行规范化工具模块。\n\n提供纯函数 normalize_newlines：将 CRLF 与孤立 CR 统一转换为 LF。\n仅使用 Python 标准库，无 I/O、无共享可变状态、无外部副作用。\n\"\"\"\n\n\ndef normalize_newlines(text: str) -> str:\n    r\"\"\"将 CRLF（\"\\r\\n\"）与孤立 CR（\"\\r\"）统一转换为 LF（\"\\n\"）。\n\n    - CRLF 与孤立 CR 都转换为单个 LF，一个 CRLF 不会被拆成两个 LF。\n    - 已有的 LF 与其余字符原样保留，包括 U+2028/U+2029 等 Unicode\n      行/段分隔符（它们不在转换范围内）。\n    - 末尾换行的有无状态原样保留：不新增、也不删除末尾换行。\n    - 纯函数且幂等：normalize_newlines(normalize_newlines(x)) 与\n      normalize_newlines(x) 结果相同；空串返回空串。\n    \"\"\"\n    text = text.replace(\"\\r\\n\", \"\\n\")\n    text = text.replace(\"\\r\", \"\\n\")\n    return text\n"},"title":"Write src/normalize_text.py","kind":"edit","content":[{"type":"diff","path":"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-fixtures/eighth-20261023/worktree/src/normalize_text.py","oldText":null,"newText":"\"\"\"换行规范化工具模块。\n\n提供纯函数 normalize_newlines：将 CRLF 与孤立 CR 统一转换为 LF。\n仅使用 Python 标准库，无 I/O、无共享可变状态、无外部副作用。\n\"\"\"\n\n\ndef normalize_newlines(text: str) -> str:\n    r\"\"\"将 CRLF（\"\\r\\n\"）与孤立 CR（\"\\r\"）统一转换为 LF（\"\\n\"）。\n\n    - CRLF 与孤立 CR 都转换为单个 LF，一个 CRLF 不会被拆成两个 LF。\n    - 已有的 LF 与其余字符原样保留，包括 U+2028/U+2029 等 Unicode\n      行/段分隔符（它们不在转换范围内）。\n    - 末尾换行的有无状态原样保留：不新增、也不删除末尾换行。\n    - 纯函数且幂等：normalize_newlines(normalize_newlines(x)) 与\n      normalize_newlines(x) 结果相同；空串返回空串。\n    \"\"\"\n    text = text.replace(\"\\r\\n\", \"\\n\")\n    text = text.replace(\"\\r\", \"\\n\")\n    return text\n"}],"locations":[{"path":"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-fixtures/eighth-20261023/worktree/src/normalize_text.py"}]}}}
