{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"bc60a5f5-8479-42a6-b00b-736df0b42d18","update":{"_meta":{"claudeCode":{"toolName":"Edit"}},"toolCallId":"call_6828e914663c41588bcddc53","sessionUpdate":"tool_call_update","rawInput":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-fixtures/eighth-20261023/worktree/README.md","old_string":">>> normalize_newlines(\"no newline\")  # 末尾无换行：不会新增\n'no newline'\n```","new_string":">>> normalize_newlines(\"no newline\")  # 末尾无换行：不会新增\n'no newline'\n\n```"},"title":"Edit README.md","kind":"edit","content":[{"type":"diff","path":"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-fixtures/eighth-20261023/worktree/README.md","oldText":">>> normalize_newlines(\"no newline\")  # 末尾无换行：不会新增\n'no newline'\n```","newText":">>> normalize_newlines(\"no newline\")  # 末尾无换行：不会新增\n'no newline'\n\n```"}],"locations":[{"path":"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-fixtures/eighth-20261023/worktree/README.md"}]}}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"bc60a5f5-8479-42a6-b00b-736df0b42d18","update":{"_meta":{"claudeCode":{"toolResponse":{"filePath":"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-fixtures/eighth-20261023/worktree/README.md","oldString":">>> normalize_newlines(\"no newline\")  # 末尾无换行：不会新增\n'no newline'\n```","newString":">>> normalize_newlines(\"no newline\")  # 末尾无换行：不会新增\n'no newline'\n\n```","originalFile":"# normalize_newlines —— 换行规范化函数\n\n本仓库提供纯函数 `normalize_newlines(text: str) -> str`：把 CRLF（`\\r\\n`）与孤立 CR（`\\r`）统一转换为 LF（`\\n`），其余内容原样保留。仅使用 Python 标准库，不引入任何第三方依赖。\n\n## 语义规则\n\n- CRLF 与孤立 CR 都转换为单个 LF；一个 CRLF 不会被拆成两个 LF。\n- 已有的 LF 与其余所有字符原样保留，包括全部 Unicode 内容；U+2028（行分隔符）与 U+2029（段分隔符）不在转换范围内，保持不变。\n- 末尾换行状态原样保留：输入末尾有换行，输出末尾仍有换行；输入末尾没有换行，不会新增。\n- 纯函数：无 I/O、无共享可变状态、无外部副作用；重复调用幂等，`normalize_newlines(normalize_newlines(x)) == normalize_newlines(x)`；空串返回空串。\n\n## 导入方式\n\n实现位于 `src/normalize_text.py`（src 布局）。导入前需把 `src` 加入模块搜索路径，两种等价做法：\n\n1. 运行时设置环境变量：`PYTHONPATH=src python your_script.py`；\n2. 在代码中把 `src/` 目录插入 `sys.path`（`tests/test_normalize_text.py` 顶部采用的就是这种做法：用 `pathlib` 定位仓库 `src/`，且仅在 `sys.path` 不含该路径时插入）。\n\n## 用法示例\n\n以下示例为 doctest 风格，输入与输出和 `src/normalize_text.py` 的实现一致：\n\n```python\n>>> from normalize_text import normalize_newlines\n\n>>> normalize_newlines(\"a\\r\\nb\\rc\\nd\")  # 混合换行：CRLF 与孤立 CR 都变为 LF\n'a\\nb\\nc\\nd'\n\n>>> normalize_newlines(\"\")  # 空串返回空串\n''\n\n>>> normalize_newlines(\"end\\r\\n\")  # 末尾有换行：规范化为 LF 后仍保留\n'end\\n'\n\n>>> normalize_newlines(\"no newline\")  # 末尾无换行：不会新增\n'no newline'\n```\n\n## 运行测试\n\n在仓库根目录执行：\n\n```console\n$ python -m unittest discover -s tests -v\n```\n\n`tests/test_normalize_text.py` 共 11 个用例，通过共享 `CASES` 表覆盖九类输入：空串、纯 LF、CRLF、单 CR、混合换行、Unicode（含 U+2028 保留）、末尾有换行、末尾无换行、连续空行；其中 `test_crlf_becomes_single_lf` 锁定替换顺序（CRLF 不拆成两个 LF），`test_no_cr_left_in_output` 断言全表输出无残留 `\\r`，`test_idempotent_across_all_cases` 以 `subTest` 断言重复规范化幂等。\n\n注意：unittest 默认把逐用例行与结尾的 `Ran 11 tests`、`OK`/`FAILED` 摘要写入 stderr；如需保存完整输出，用 `2>&1` 合并两个流：\n\n```console\n$ python -m unittest discover -s tests -v 2>&1 | tee unittest-output.txt\n```\n\n若环境中只有 `python3` 命令，把上述命令中的 `python` 等价替换为 `python3` 即可。\n\n也可以把本文档的示例作为 doctest 执行，核对文档与实现的一致性（通过时无输出）：\n\n```console\n$ PYTHONPATH=src python -m doctest README.md\n```\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":34,"oldLines":6,"newStart":34,"newLines":7,"lines":[" "," >>> normalize_newlines(\"no newline\")  # 末尾无换行：不会新增"," 'no newline'","+"," ```"," "," ## 运行测试"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"toolName":"Edit"}},"toolCallId":"call_6828e914663c41588bcddc53","sessionUpdate":"tool_call_update","content":[{"type":"diff","path":"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-fixtures/eighth-20261023/worktree/README.md","oldText":"\n>>> normalize_newlines(\"no newline\")  # 末尾无换行：不会新增\n'no newline'\n```\n\n## 运行测试","newText":"\n>>> normalize_newlines(\"no newline\")  # 末尾无换行：不会新增\n'no newline'\n\n```\n\n## 运行测试"}],"locations":[{"path":"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-fixtures/eighth-20261023/worktree/README.md","line":34}]}}}
